          "judge": "openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna",
          "quote_span": "In our report, we described the risk as follows : “The risk stems from what study participants view as a straightforward progression: AI tools are more likely to foster dependence. As students increasingly use these tools, and ‘offload’ an increasing amount of their cognitive tasks to these tools, a positive feedback loop emerges where they see positive results in terms of grades and in time and effort saved. These outcomes then create increased dependence on AI tools, increased ‘cognitive offloading,’ and increased ‘cognitive decline’” (p. 56).",
